      "controle": "Risk management related to usage of Artificial Intelligence (AI)",
      "document": "3.77.1 The following supporting materials will be shared: a Microsoft Forms questionnaire detailing the questions raised and the target population, along with a centralized register consolidating identified AI use cases, including both raw inputs and the associated risk qualification based on collected responses. In addition, a one-page executive summary for Management will be provided, as well as a scoping note and a dedicated AI usage governance framework outlining our methodology. Finally, our operational tool used for the identification and risk classification of AI use cases will also be made available.Finally, supporting documentation will be shared to evidence the training and awareness sessions carried out within Treasury.",
